  (text "SCC $C010: A0 = D/C, A1 = A/B.  PCLK 7.3728 MHz from the CPLD (x16 mode:\nTC 0 = 115200, TC 22 = 9600 baud).  DCD tied low so the receiver is always\nenabled; CTS pulled up (inactive) when no cable is fitted.  Auto Enables\nmode gives hardware flow control: CTS gates the transmitter.\nHeaders use the FTDI TTL-232R 6-pin order: 1 GND, 2 RTS out (to the\ncable's CTS#), 3 VCC, 4 RxD in, 5 TxD out, 6 CTS in.  Channel A is the\nconsole: a USB-C USB-serial module (FT232RL or CH340, set to 5 V) plugs in\nhere and its VCC (USB_5V) can power the board.  Channel B pin 3 is unused." (at 25.4 168.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid f3f6acc3-c7c5-46d8-a8c2-ccf789d5539b)
  )
